Subject: [PATCH 1/2] product-ux: incorporate SRS v1.1 Delegation amendment

Adds Delegation Management (SCR-020) to the Product Requirements +
UX/UI Specification, closing the downstream gate recorded in
project-management/SRS-v1.1-AUDIT.md.

- New screen SCR-020 Delegation Management (Administrator only)
- Delegation CRUD/UX: create, view, revoke (no edit)
- Delegation states: Active / Expired / Revoked (icon+label+color)
- Automatic expiration + explicit, confirmed, attributable revocation
- Effective permission model: permanent role + currently valid delegations
- Admin-only access (UX-DEC-002): no visible entry point for Staff
- New PR-017-021, UI-015, UX-012 with traceability to
  FR-DEL-001-014, BR-031-039, DR-DEL, VAL-023-029, UC-019-021
- Updated Final Product/UX Audit -> v1.1 APPROVED
- New 11-Product-UX-v1.1-Changelog.md itemizing every change

No SRS-layer requirement IDs invented; all trace to
docs/26-Delegation-Requirements-v1.1.md.
