+**Layout:** Single screen, list-first, matching the Inventory History pattern rather than a separate Add/Edit screen (delegation is a short, single-purpose grant, not a multi-field master-data record): Header ("Delegation Management," "+ Create Delegation" button top-right) → Filter bar (Recipient, Responsibility, Status) → DataGridView (main content) → footer (row count). "Create Delegation" opens a compact modal panel over the same screen; it is not a separately numbered screen (see 3.1).
