+## 9.1a Resolved — Delegation Visibility to Staff *(SRS v1.1)*
+
+**Decision:** Delegation Management (SCR-020) is Administrator-only with no visible entry point, disabled or otherwise, for Inventory/Store Staff. A Staff recipient never sees "you have been delegated X" as a distinct UI concept — the delegated capability simply becomes usable at its normal location for the duration it is valid.
+
+**Decision ID:** UX-DEC-002
+
+**Reason:** SRS v1.1 §26.7 requires the UI to "not provide delegation controls to Staff" but does not specify whether a recipient should be notified in-app. The conservative interpretation — no separate notification surface, no distinct "delegated" visual treatment on Stock-In/Stock-Out/Reports — avoids inventing a notification feature the SRS does not require.
+
+**Affected screens:** SCR-020; implicitly SCR-012/013/016 (no visual change when a capability is delegated vs. permanent).
+
+**Status:** Resolved before visual-design handoff.
