+# 11. Product/UX v1.1 Changelog — Delegation Management
+
+## Purpose
+
+This document records exactly what changed in the Product Requirements + UX/UI Specification to close the downstream gate opened by the SRS v1.1 Delegation amendment (`project-management/SRS-v1.1-AUDIT.md`, `project-management/SRS-v1.1-CHANGELOG.md`). It is the Product/UX equivalent of the SRS's own v1.1 changelog and exists so that no delegation-related change in this package can be mistaken for an undocumented scope addition.
+
+## Trigger
+
+**SRS v1.1 §26.8 Traceability Impact** and the **SRS-v1.1-AUDIT.md Downstream Gate** both state that this package was out of date relative to SRS v1.1 until Delegation Management was added consistently across information architecture, screen inventory, UX flows, screen specifications, requirements traceability, and the final audit. This changelog closes that gate.
+
+## Documents Updated
+
+| Document | Change |
+|---|---|
+| `00-README.md` | Version bumped to v1.1; document map updated; new file 11 added to the map |
+| `01-Product-Vision-and-UX-Strategy.md` | Administrator/Staff role descriptions updated with delegation capabilities and limits; new §1.3.4 Effective Permission Model |
+| `02-Information-Architecture-and-Navigation.md` | New IA row for Delegation Management; new note on delegation's effect on navigation/sidebar visibility |
+| `03-Screen-Inventory.md` | Screen count updated 19 → 20; new row SCR-020 Delegation Management; new §3.3 Delegation Permission Rule (UX-DEC-002) |
+| `04-User-Flows.md` | Three new flows: §4.15 Create Delegation, §4.16 Revoke Delegation, §4.17 View Delegation History |
+| `05-Screen-Specifications.md` | New §5.15 full screen specification for SCR-020 (layout, components, actions, states, status badges) |
+| `06-CRUD-Inventory-Validation-Error-UX.md` | New §6.3.1 Delegation Status UX; new validation message rows (VAL-023–029); new empty-state row; new confirmation-dialog specifics for Revoke |
+| `08-Requirements-PR-UI-UX-Traceability.md` | New PR-017–021, UI-015, UX-012; five new traceability rows; §8.5 MVP/Future updated with delegation-adjacent Future items |
+| `09-Design-Recommendations-and-Claude-Brief.md` | New §9.1a Resolved (UX-DEC-002) and §9.1b Logged-not-designed (delegation notification/approval workflow); Visual Design Brief navigation and status-indicator paragraphs updated |
+| `10-Final-Product-UX-Audit.md` | Nine new audit rows specific to delegation; §10.1 Final Sign-Off items 3–4 added; §10.2 Permission Model gains a Delegation Management row; verdict updated to v1.1 |
+| `11-Product-UX-v1.1-Changelog.md` | This file (new) |
+
+## New Downstream IDs Introduced by This Package
+
+These are Product/UX-layer IDs (PR-, UI-, UX-, SCR-, UX-DEC-) introduced to represent SRS v1.1 requirements at the design level. No SRS-layer ID (FR-, BR-, DR-, VAL-, UC-, OBJ-) was invented here — all are taken as-is from `docs/26-Delegation-Requirements-v1.1.md`.
+
+- **Screen:** SCR-020 — Delegation Management
+- **Product Requirements:** PR-017, PR-018, PR-019, PR-020, PR-021
+- **UI Requirements:** UI-015
+- **UX Requirements:** UX-012
+- **Design Decision:** UX-DEC-002 — Delegation Visibility to Staff
+
+## Traceability Confirmation
+
+Every new element added by this changelog traces to one or more of: `FR-DEL-001–014`, `BR-031–039`, `DR-DEL`, `VAL-023–029`, `UC-019–021` (SRS v1.1, `docs/26-Delegation-Requirements-v1.1.md`). No functionality, screen, business rule, or requirement ID beyond what SRS v1.1 defines has been introduced. Items that would extend delegation further (notifications, acceptance workflow, delegation chains, delegated User Management/Inventory Adjustment) are explicitly logged as Future in `09-Design-Recommendations-and-Claude-Brief.md` §9.1b and `08-Requirements-PR-UI-UX-Traceability.md` §8.5, not designed into MVP.
+
+## Verdict
+
